{
    "Dialogue": [
        {
            "text": "Phew, thanks for the help! I thought I would die in here!",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 25,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "What happened here? What were those things?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 12,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "Chill out, Bob. Those were only machines.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 0,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "Machines?! Demons are what they are! Who would make something like this?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 12,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "I made them!",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 25,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "Why would you create something you cannot even control properly?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 13,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "That... Wasn't part of the plan.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 25,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "Are you trying to raise some kind of army? Is Archades resorting to machines to fight for them?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 9,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "No you got it all wrong. Last week, the empire delivered a whole batch of goodies.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 25,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "Let me guess... You found a Blade Engine amongst the \"goodies\"?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 0,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "How do you know?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 25,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "It's ours. We're here for that Engine.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 9,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "Bummer. Anyway, this is exavtly what I needed to complete my FriendMaker Mk2.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 25,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "Mk2? What happened to the first one?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 0,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "Trust me, you don't want to know.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 25,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "True, we do not want to. So what's the FriendMaker?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 13,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "Well... You know... It can get pretty lonely out here, so I thought I could repair an old sentry assembler...",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 25,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "How did you find one? The only one in working order was the one in Landfall Village.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 5,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "Easy. We're above an Old World Bunker.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 25,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "What? Zack, Kira, we have to take a look a this place!",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 5,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "Really? Well that simplifies things!",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 25,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "How so?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 9,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "Well, the FriendMaker Mk2 is still making these machines, it would be nice if you guys could turn it off.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 25,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "Why would we do that? It's your problem.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 0,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "Zack, the engine...",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 9,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "Right! Forgot about that! Welp, let's bash some machines. Bob, you in?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 0,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "Absolutely not, pupil! I'd rather eat my blade than step foot in this hellhole!",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 12,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "He's in.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 0,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
